# ======================================================================
# 🧱 Tasqly Project – .gitignore
# ======================================================================
# 📌 Purpose : Keep repository clean & professional
# 📂 Scope   : Exclude build artifacts, IDE clutter, auto-generated files,
#              UML exports, logs, coverage data, and other non-source files.
# 🧱 Layer   : Infrastructure (Repo Hygiene)
# 👤 Author  : Mohamed Ali
# 🗓️ Created : 2025-08-27
# 🗓️ Updated : 2025-11-17 (updated with additional patterns and cleanup)
# ======================================================================

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 🔨 CMake / Build System
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
build*/
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
Makefile
*.ninja
.ninja_*
CMakeLists.txt.user
CMakePresets.json.user
DartConfiguration.tcl

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# ⚙️ Binaries / Libraries
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.a
*.lib
*.pdb

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 🎨 Qt / QML Generated
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
*.qrc.depends
*.qmlc
*.jsc
*.moc
*.autogen/
*.rcc/
*.qmake.*
*.pro.user*
*.qmlproject.user
*.qmlproject.qtds

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 🖥️ IDE / Editor Configurations
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
*.user
*.user.*
*.swp
*.swo
*.sln
*.vcxproj*
.idea/
.vscode/
*.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.clangd/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 🧪 Testing / Logs / Coverage
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
Testing/Temporary/
test-results/
coverage/
*.gcda
*.gcno
*.gcov
*.lcov
*.profraw
*.profdata

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 🐍 Python (scripts/)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 📦 External / Vendored Libraries
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
externals/*
!externals/CMakeLists.txt   # keep control file
/externals/postgresql/lib/
/externals/postgresql/include/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 📐 UML Tools & Exports
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/uml/libs/
docs/uml/exports/
docs/uml/**/*.svg
docs/uml/**/*.png
docs/uml/**/*.rar
docs/uml/**/*.tmp
docs/uml/**/*.bak

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 📊 Reports (auto-generated snapshots / summaries)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
reports/**/*.json
reports/**/*.md

# ✅ Keep full benchmarks and tests reports
!reports/benchmarks/**
!reports/tests/**

!reports/Template.md          # keep reusable template
!reports/**/Phase*/**/*.md    # keep phase reports
!reports/**/Release*.md       # keep release reports

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 📊 Performance / Temp Logs
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
performance/
tests_tmp/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 📦 Documentation Builds
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/_build/
docs/generated/
docs/api/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 🖥️ System Files
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
.directory
*~
*.sublime-*
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
*.swo